[Host] Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

50
00:07:00,576 --> 00:07:07,920
[Slow] 日本では、秋に、何という魚をよく食べますか。

51
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:13,279
[Host] The Pacific saury — the famous autumn fish we heard about today.

52
00:07:13,879 --> 00:07:22,927
