[Slow] 今年のサンマの味は、どうですか。

55
00:07:36,983 --> 00:07:41,303
[Host] It is said to be very good. The fish are big and fatty.

56
00:07:41,903 --> 00:07:56,951
[Host] That's all for today. This autumn fish may be expensive this year, but many people still want to taste it at least once this season. If you visit Japan in autumn, try it grilled with a little salt — it's a classic. See you tomorrow.

57
00:07:57,552 --> 00:07:59,951
[News] また明日。
